WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.080
- [Narrator] What if I told you

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:02.781
alcohol could make you live longer?

00:00:02.781 --> 00:00:03.820
(bouncy music)

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:06.061
For the residents of a
small Japanese island

00:00:06.061 --> 00:00:07.853
that seems to hold true.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.840
Known as the Island of Longevity,

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.950
Tokunoshima is home to the
world's highest percentage

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.560
of people living beyond 100 years.

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:24.080
Legend has it the reason
people are living longer

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.480
is a special kind of
Japanese spirit called shochu

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.810
made only by local distillers.

00:00:32.457 --> 00:00:36.540
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:00:41.313 --> 00:00:44.313
(metallic rattling)

00:01:21.198 --> 00:01:23.365
(banging)

00:01:59.866 --> 00:02:02.449
(bouncy music)

00:02:08.733 --> 00:02:11.733
(rhythmic clapping)

00:02:23.011 --> 00:02:25.178
(chiming)

